      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شَقَّاقٌ</span></b> , meaning One <i>who glories,</i> or <i>boasts,
vainly, and praises himself for that which is not
in him,</i> is not of the [classical] language of the
Arabs. (L, TA.)

